--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
voro++  —  VORONOI / POLYHEDRAL-DUAL REFERENCE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Upstream:   https://github.com/chr1shr/voro
  Origin:     The Regents of the University of California, through Lawrence
              Berkeley National Laboratory (LBNL).
